{"id":"wb-6-251","name":"于谦墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"于谦墓","text":"于谦墓，位于中华人民共和国浙江省杭州市西湖区西湖南岸的三台山山麓，是明朝兵部尚书于谦的墓葬。该墓于明朝天顺三年（1459年）建成，最早在于氏家族祖坟内。弘治二年（1489年）时在墓旁建旌功祠。文化大革命期间，于谦墓区的地表建筑几乎被全毁。1982年，于谦墓重修并重立墓碑。该墓坐西朝东，墓冢呈马蹄形，墓前建有墓道，墓道两侧安放有六对石像生。2006年，于谦墓被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%8E%E8%B0%A6%E5%A2%93","revisionId":94143780,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94143780","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/418f04f326a2419b0594a2e9.jpg","title":"20241018_Tomb_of_Yu_Qian.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241018_Tomb_of_Yu_Qian.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/20241018_Tomb_of_Yu_Qian.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Tomb of Yu Qian","width":320,"height":240}}